1
00:00:00,987 --> 00:00:02,117
(Howard:)Yes.

2
00:00:02,121 --> 00:00:03,521
(Penny:)Those are also the side effects

3
00:00:03,523 --> 00:00:05,653
(Penny:)of having a 75-year-old man
with an erection

4
00:00:05,658 --> 00:00:07,358
(Penny:)climb on top of you.

5
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:09,360
(Bernadette:)Want to stop here?

6
00:00:09,362 --> 00:00:10,692
(Penny:)Uh, no.
I can keep going.

7
00:00:10,697 --> 00:00:11,897
(Bernadette:)Nah, you got this.

8
00:00:11,898 --> 00:00:13,398
(Bernadette:)Let's go for a drink.
I'll call Amy.

9
00:00:13,399 --> 00:00:16,269
(Penny:)Okay, good. She seemed like she
really wanted to go out tonight.

10
00:00:20,173 --> 00:00:22,243
(ringtone playing)

11
00:00:25,178 --> 00:00:27,178
(Amy(on phone):)Hey, girl.

12
00:00:31,884 --> 00:00:35,884
(Leonard:)Okay, next question,
for the Butterfinger:

13
00:00:35,888 --> 00:00:38,558
how long is a galactic year?

14
00:00:38,558 --> 00:00:39,888
250 million years!

15
00:00:39,892 --> 00:00:40,492
Yes!

16
00:00:40,493 --> 00:00:43,423
(all cheering)

17
00:00:43,429 --> 00:00:47,769
(Howard:)Okay, this one is
for a Cadbury Creme Egg.

18
00:00:47,767 --> 00:00:49,637
(gasps)
It's not even Easter time.

19
00:00:49,636 --> 00:00:51,666
This is crazy!

20
00:00:53,006 --> 00:00:57,306
(Howard:)Which Archimedean solid
has 20 regular triangular faces,

21
00:00:57,310 --> 00:00:59,880
(Howard:)30 square faces,
12 pentagonal faces,

22
00:00:59,879 --> 00:01:03,679
(Howard:)60 vertices and 120 edges?

23
00:01:03,683 --> 00:01:06,013
ALL:
The Rhombicosidodecahedron!

24
00:01:06,019 --> 00:01:06,589
Yes!

25
00:01:06,586 --> 00:01:09,256
(all cheering)

26
00:01:09,255 --> 00:01:10,955
We are so smart!

27
00:01:10,957 --> 00:01:12,757
(Raj:)Why didn't girls like us
in high school?

28
00:01:12,759 --> 00:01:16,159
(Howard:)Because we were awkward and
weird and couldn't play sports!
Right again!

